  unitName: Wild Edge Serge
  unitId: 30846
  unitNumber: 1459
  description: An assassin who served a lion demon and their daughter. Born in another
    world, he was originally an ordinary acrobat who adapted his skills for combat
    in order to survive in Ishgria. After receiving the patronage of a half-lion,
    half-divine demon that was tolerant of other races, he rescued his master's daughter
    in the chaos of the lion demon clan's defeat. He also began a journey to Grand
    Gaia in order to aid her in claiming vengeance, but he encountered an Elder Summoner
    along the way who had come to search for the daughter of the dragon demon clan's
    leader. He is said to have fallen at the end of their desperate battle.
  summonDesc: So I'm able to visit this world again... I'll work to repay you for
    calling me here. I'm a man who pays his debts, after all.
  fusionDesc: Enough, stop already!<br>It scares me just to think of what you're
    going to ask of me.
